   "t": 58,
   "fen": "r1b1k1nr/pppp1ppp/2N2q2/2b5/4P3/8/PPP2PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 1 6",
   "line": [
    "Qf6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The queen to f6 — an in-between move; we do not recapture the knight yet."
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 66,
   "fen": "r1b1k1nr/pppp1ppp/2N2q2/2b5/4P3/5P2/PPP3PP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "f3"
   ],
   "spoken": "He props things up with f3."
  },
