   "fen": "r1b1k1nr/ppp2ppp/2p2q2/2b5/4P3/5P2/PPP3PP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "dxc6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Recapture with the d-pawn — it opens the diagonal for the bishop, and f3 has already weakened his king."
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
