   "fen": "r1b1k2r/ppp1nppp/2p5/2b2P2/2B1P3/8/P1PQK1PP/qN5R b kq - 1 12",
   "line": [
    "Ke2"
   ],
   "spoken": "And he still can't castle — that's what kills him; the king has to walk out just to defend the knight."
